# Guitar Tool Project Context & Task Tracker

## Current Goals (Requested)
- [ ] **String Strokes / Hits:** Improve visual feedback when a string is played (strokes/hits).
- [ ] **Sound Sensitivity & Detection:** Optimize YinDetector params, ensure faster and more accurate pitch detection with no errors.
- [ ] **UI/UX & Waves:** Enhance WaveVisualizer, make UI responsive for different screen sizes, add landscape mode support.
- [ ] **Tuning Instructions & Capo:** Improve the "tune up/down" information display and Capo/Fret placement UI.
- [ ] **Routing:** Upgrade/optimize routing (currently React Navigation, considering Expo Router or just polishing the current tabs).

## Progress
- Analyzed existing `useTuner` hook, `WaveVisualizer`, `TunerStateBanner`, and `NoteDisplay`.
- Found `YinDetector` config which can be tuned for better sensitivity.
- The UI currently lacks explicit "string hit / stroke" animations.
- Need to add landscape support in `useLayout` and components.
